  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building STEM Human Capacities to support achieving SD in the Arab region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program focuses on fostering STEM education in a new and innovative transformative institutional manner to allow Member States meet the challenges that they are facing towards achieving Sustainable Development. This is a timely initiative to prepare the Arab region in developing the required robust science agenda for the coming Global Ministerial STI meeting planned in Columbia during October 2024. The demo program calls for the initiation and implementation of a number of large-scale national and sub-regional training schemes for scientists, engineers and jobless college graduates with a set of approaches to build the scientific tempo in local communities towards better socio-economic livelihoods by ensuring inclusive participation of all spheres of society in supporting scientific endeavors and in promoting careers in science.</narrative>
  </description>
